From a83604f938dae73b2e63948856de46131b00be94 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:03:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] LAYOUT110-2 (web): BinSelect / Lot Info developer notes not
 shown
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 20260930 (screenshot of the BinSelect note "字色＝golden MyBinSel Font->Color … tcBinColor 色表目前是全 0 的占位 …"):
"圖片上的 不用有".
- page/Status.ShowBinSelect.html: .sbsNote (5 golden / port notes: font colour, fContact->fShow, UPH, NUMBER_PANEL,
  Auto Clean count) hidden.
- page/Data.LotInfo.html: .nowire (22 blocks of "可見條件 … / 未接 …" per tab, none holds a control) hidden.
Scan of the 9 start-up pages for other visible developer text: the rest (.dfm / .cpp names) is inside the .srcnote footers,
already hidden (LAYOUT110); the main screen's "C++ OFFLINE" badge is a debug-mode switch and already hidden in release.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 page/Data.LotInfo.html         | 3 +++
 page/Status.ShowBinSelect.html | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/page/Data.LotInfo.html b/page/Data.LotInfo.html
index 97ad05b..71a9662 100644
--- a/page/Data.LotInfo.html
+++ b/page/Data.LotInfo.html
@@ -16,6 +16,9 @@
   .liPnl{display:inline-block;min-width:110px;padding:2px 8px;border:1px solid #888;text-align:center;}
   .nowire{font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text,#222);}
   .nowire .why{color:var(--text-dim,#667);}
+  /* AI(W906-LAYOUT110) 20260930：EastSun「一些根本用不到的標示隱藏」／BinSelect 同類說明「不用有」—— .nowire 是「可見條件／未接」的開發說明
+     （22 塊，裡面沒有任何控制項），客戶畫面一律不顯示 */
+  .nowire{display:none !important;}
   .liImg{display:inline-block;width:190px;height:96px;border:1px dashed #888;margin:2px;text-align:center;line-height:96px;color:var(--text-dim,#667);}
   #mmTesterLog{width:100%;height:220px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border:1px inset #aaa;background:var(--input-bg,#fff);color:var(--text,#222);padding:2px;}
   table.yield td.liL{text-align:left;}
diff --git a/page/Status.ShowBinSelect.html b/page/Status.ShowBinSelect.html
index 22876b3..3ac8241 100644
--- a/page/Status.ShowBinSelect.html
+++ b/page/Status.ShowBinSelect.html
@@ -16,6 +16,8 @@
   .sbsIdx td{padding:2px 8px;}
   .sbsIdx td.v{min-width:60px;text-align:right;font-weight:bold;}
   .sbsNote{font-size:11px;color:#666;margin-top:4px;}
+  /* AI(W906-LAYOUT110) 20260930：EastSun（BinSelect 截圖）「圖片上的 不用有」—— .sbsNote 是給開發看的 golden／移植說明，客戶畫面一律不顯示 */
+  .sbsNote{display:none !important;}
   #sbsStatus{font-size:11px;margin-top:4px;min-height:14px;}
 </style>
 </head>
-- 
